{"4825060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mining Guild Idle", "steam_appid": 4825060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Guild Idle is an inventory / resource management based incremental style game featuring <strong>15 to 20 hours of gameplay</strong>.  Start with basic mining extraction to sell ores, to completing quests, to eventually manufacturing drones which scavenge and extract various resources, items and other valuables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your fleet and ore output to maximize profit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/cba16c9b92502f4634b13fb8710b3fd3.poster.avif?t=1787246816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/cba16c9b92502f4634b13fb8710b3fd3.webm?t=1787246816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/cba16c9b92502f4634b13fb8710b3fd3.mp4?t=1787246816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Quests for vendors by sources different ores and items they request</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/de09b2b741559f75088a733cdccb4d45.poster.avif?t=1787246816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/de09b2b741559f75088a733cdccb4d45.webm?t=1787246816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4825060/extras/de09b2b741559f75088a733cd